    Title = 'Custom Perfume Bottle Labels: Glass, Oil and Small Type'
    Description = 'Plan custom perfume bottle labels around curved glass, handling oil, small text, gift boxes and a proof on the filled bottle.'
    Category = 'Fragrance packaging'
    CardDescription = 'Choose label dimensions and finishes after testing the real bottle, cap and carton together.'
